%% V0.11.6 启动时序（便携落点决策 + 老数据迁移）— as-built
%% 权威文档：docs/design/v0.11.6-portable-data-dir.md §3、docs/decisions/ADR-050.md
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R as lib.rs::run()
  participant PB as app::preboot
  participant P as app::portable_boot
  participant PR as app::portable_prompt
  participant FS as infra::portable_probe
  participant A as platform::app_dir
  participant M as infra::portable_migrate
  participant B as app::bootstrap
  participant D as infra::db

  R->>R: boot_timing::start()
  R->>R: ctx = generate_context!()
  R->>PB: prepare(Paths::resolve(identifier), identifier)
  PB-->>R: Proceed | Abort → exit(2)
  Note over PB: 品牌改名迁移（LEGACY_IDENTIFIER → com.timing.app）<br/>先在 %APPDATA% 内部完成
  R->>P: prepare(identifier)
  P->>A: exe_dir()（None → use_appdata("exe-dir-unavailable")）
  P->>PR: webview2_ok()?（所有桌面启动都跑；缺失 → ask_webview2() → exit(4)）
  P->>A: appdata_dir(identifier)
  P->>FS: read_optout(appdata)
  alt portable-optout.json 存在
    P->>A: set(Roots{appdata, appdata/plugins, portable:false})
  else 未选择过
    loop 探测可写性
      P->>FS: probe(<exe>\data)
      FS-->>P: Ok | Err(reason)
      P->>PR: ask_permission(reason, data_dir)
      PR-->>P: Proceed(重试) | AppData(detail) | Quit
    end
    P->>P: remove_dir(<exe>\data)（探测建出的空目录，否则迁移 rename 必失败）
    P->>M: run_once(appdata, <exe>\data)
    M->>M: 判据 → copy_tree → verify → stash_aside(<identifier>.portable-premigrate-<ts>) → rename → write_marker
    Note over M: 备份落在 %APPDATA%\<identifier> 的**兄弟**目录，不是旧目录里面；永不删除
    M-->>P: Outcome
    alt Migrated / NoLegacy / AlreadyPresent
      P->>P: move_plugins(<data>\plugins → <exe>\plugins，目标不存在才 rename)
      P->>A: set(Roots{<exe>/data, <exe>/plugins, portable:true})
    else Failed
      P->>PR: ask_migrate_failed(reason, source)
      PR-->>P: Proceed(重试) | AppData(detail) | Quit
    end
  end
  opt 落到 AppData
    P->>FS: probe(appdata)（不可写 → ask_no_data_dir() → exit(3)）
    P->>FS: write_optout(appdata, reason, detail)
    P->>A: set(Roots{appdata, appdata/plugins, portable:false})
    P->>PR: ask_appdata_notice(appdata)
  end
  R->>B: Builder::setup → bootstrap::setup(app)
  B->>A: data_root() / is_portable()
  B->>B: record_portable()（读 portable_boot::note() 补记日志）
  B->>B: log::init / boot_timing::set_dir / md_backup::set_root
  B->>D: init_pool(&data_root)
  D-->>B: SqlitePool
  B->>B: ensure_defaults → manage(AppState) → tray → reclamp → diagnostics → jobs
